{"speciesId":566,"names":{"fr":"Arkéapti","es":"Archen","en":"Archen","ja":"アーケン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"On dit qu’il serait l’ancêtre de tous les Pokémon Oiseaux. Il ne sait pas voler et se déplace en sautant d’arbre en arbre."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Said to be an ancestor of bird Pokémon, they were unable to fly and moved about by hopping from one branch to another."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Un Pokémon recréé à partir d’un fossile. On pense qu’il est l’ancêtre de tous les Pokémon Oiseaux."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Revived from a fossil, this Pokémon is thought to be the ancestor of all bird Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It was revived from an ancient fossil. Not able to fly, it lived in treetops and hopped from one branch to another."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It was revived from an ancient fossil. Not able to fly, it lived in treetops and hopped from one branch to another."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Un Pokémon recréé à partir d’un fossile. On pense qu’il est l’ancêtre de tous les Pokémon Oiseaux."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Pokémon que renació de un fósil. Dicen que es el antepasado de todos los Pokémon pájaro."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Revived from a fossil, this Pokémon is thought to be the ancestor of all bird Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"化石から 復活した ポケモン。 あらゆる とりポケモンの 祖先と 考えられている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"On dit qu’il serait l’ancêtre de tous les Pokémon Oiseaux. Il ne sait pas voler et se déplace en sautant d’arbre en arbre."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Dicen que es el Pokémon pájaro primigenio. No puede volar, así que solo salta de rama en rama."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Said to be an ancestor of bird Pokémon, they were unable to fly and moved about by hopping from one branch to another."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"とりポケモンの 祖先と 言われる。 飛ぶことは できず 枝から 枝へ 飛び移り 生活していたらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Un Pokémon recréé à partir d’un fossile. On pense qu’il est l’ancêtre de tous les Pokémon Oiseaux."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Pokémon que renació de un fósil. Dicen que es el antepasado de todos los Pokémon pájaro."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Revived from a fossil, this Pokémon is thought to be the ancestor of all bird Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"化石から 復活した ポケモン。 あらゆる とりポケモンの 祖先と 考えられている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"On dit qu’il serait l’ancêtre de tous les Pokémon Oiseaux. Il ne sait pas voler et se déplace en sautant d’arbre en arbre."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Dicen que es el Pokémon pájaro primigenio. No puede volar, así que solo salta de rama en rama."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Said to be an ancestor of bird Pokémon, they were unable to fly and moved about by hopping from one branch to another."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"とりポケモンの 祖先と 言われる。 飛ぶことは できず 枝から 枝へ 飛び移り 生活していたらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il est l’ancêtre commun de tous les Pokémon oiseaux. Incapable de voler, il se déplaçait en planant depuis la cime des arbres."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"El antecesor de todo Pokémon pájaro. Como era incapaz de volar, se desplazaba saltando de árbol en árbol."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It is the ancestor of all bird Pokémon. Archen itself could not actually fly but moved by hopping from treetop to treetop."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"あらゆる とりポケモンの 祖先。 アーケン自体は まだ 飛べず 木の上を ジャンプして 移動した。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Ce Pokémon était apparemment incapable de voler. Il savait néanmoins planer depuis la cime des arbres pour fondre sur ses proies."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Al parecer no podía volar, por lo que se lanzaba desde las copas de árboles altos para planear y atrapar así a su presa."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"To all appearances flightless, it was able to glide down from tall treetops to snag its prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"飛ぶことは できなかった ようだが 高い 木の上 から 滑空し 獲物を 捕っていたらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il a longtemps été considéré comme l’ancêtre commun de tous les Pokémon oiseaux, mais des études récentes réfutent cette théorie."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Siempre se ha creído que era el antecesor de los Pokémon pájaro, aunque investigaciones recientes lo ponen en duda."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Once thought to be the ancestor of all bird Pokémon, some of the latest research suggests that may not be the case."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"あらゆる とりポケモンの 祖先と 考えられてきたが 最近の 研究では 違うという 説も。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Bien qu’il ait des ailes, ce Pokémon antique recréé à partir d’un fossile est incapable de voler."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Este Pokémon pájaro ancestral, regenerado a partir de un fósil, es incapaz de volar pese a tener alas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Restored from a fossil, this ancient bird Pokémon has wings but can’t yet fly."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"化石から 復元された。 羽は あるが まだ 飛ぶことは できない 古代の とりポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Les recherches ont montré que ce Pokémon restauré à partir d’un fossile ne pouvait pas voler, mais qu’il était très doué en saut."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Fue regenerado a partir de un fósil. Tal y como apuntaban las investigaciones, no puede volar, pero los saltos son su punto fuerte."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon was successfully restored from a fossil. As research suggested, Archen is unable to fly. But it’s very good at jumping."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"化石から 復元に 成功。 研究の とおり 飛べないが ジャンプは 得意な ポケモンだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"On dit que c’est l’ancêtre des Pokémon oiseaux. Il vivait à la cime des arbres et se nourrissait de Baies et de Pokémon Insecte."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Se dice que es el antepasado de los Pokémon pájaro. Vivía en las copas de los árboles y se alimentaba de bayas y Pokémon insecto."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Archen is said to be the ancestor of bird Pokémon. It lived in treetops, eating berries and bug Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"鳥ポケモンの 祖先と 言われる。 木の上で 暮らし 木の実や 虫ポケモンを 食っていた。"}],"varieties":[{"id":566,"moves":[{"name":"cut","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"wing-attack","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",6]]},{"name":"thrash","learns":[[11,"level-up",51],[14,"level-up",51],[15,"level-up",50],[16,"level-up",50],[17,"level-up",50],[18,"level-up",50],[20,"level-up",42]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"rock-throw","learns":[[11,"level-up",5],[14,"level-up",5],[15,"level-up",5],[16,"level-up",5],[17,"level-up",5],[18,"level-up",5],[20,"level-up",3]]},{"name":"earthquake","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"dig","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",